  "description": "⭐ <em>Don’t miss the </em><strong><em>Paddington Christmas Lights Bus Tour</em></strong><em>, a magical Christmas sightseeing tour through London aboard a classic Routemaster bus, brought to you by Brigit’s Bakery, renowned for its delightful afternoon tea experiences. Enjoy festive afternoon tea, sparkling Regent Street lights and Paddington-guided stories along the journey.</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>🎉 Enjoy Paddington™ fun all year round—book the Paddington™ Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Tour </strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/602434?thm=12314\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>here</strong></a><strong>! 🎉</strong><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🚌 Ride a twinkling classic Routemaster through London’s festive streets<br>\n🍰 Enjoy a Paddington-themed afternoon tea with the famous marmalade sandwich<br>\n✨ Admire Regent Street Christmas lights and iconic London landmarks<br>\n🐻 Follow charming animated stories from Paddington and Mrs Bird on board<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Dietary Requirements</strong><br>\n<strong>🚩After booking, you’ll be asked to select your menu and share any dietary requirements. Please double-check your choices, as they cannot be changed once submitted.🚩</strong><br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour and 30 minutes&nbsp;<br>\n<strong>📍 Departure: </strong><strong>8 Northumberland Avenue, WC2N 5BY, outside the Grand Hotel&nbsp;</strong><br>\n👤 Age requirement: 5+<br>\n❗<strong>&nbsp;Any allergies must be emailed and confirmed by management at bus@b-bakery.com.&nbsp;</strong>❗<br>\n♿ Accessibility: please refer to the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/plan/faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FAQs</a><br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/bus-tours/paddington-afternoon-tea-bus-tour\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nHop aboard a beautifully decorated classic Routemaster bus for a festive London adventure! The <em>Paddington Christmas Lights Bus Tour</em> pairs twinkling city views with a delightful Paddington-themed afternoon tea, complete with the famous marmalade sandwich. Glide past iconic landmarks and the dazzling Regent Street lights while enjoying charming animated stories from Paddington and Mrs Bird along the way. Get your tickets today for the <em>Paddington Christmas Lights Bus Tour</em> in London!<br>\n<br>\n© P&amp;Co.&nbsp;Ltd./SC&nbsp;2026<br>\nLicensed on behalf of Studiocanal S.A.S by Copyrights Group",
